Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 01:33:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(loader): recover file-sourced imports after the imported
 file is moved

Fixes #112

- When a flow references a node via a file source and the stored relative
  path no longer resolves (imported file moved to another folder), the
  loader now searches the project for a file with the same basename and
  best path-suffix match instead of failing hard.
- Direct hits keep the exact previous behavior (zero change for healthy
  flows). Unresolvable cases still throw the original error.
- No new dependencies; search skips node_modules/.git/dist and is
  depth- and results-capped.
- Adds recoverMovedFileSource.spec.ts (5 mocha cases, hermetic fixtures).
